Package: winos-api
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: WinOs-Layer Contributors <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: systemd | systemd-sysv
Recommends: openssl
Provides: winos-api
Conflicts: winos-api-fake
Replaces: winos-api (<< @VERSION@)
Homepage: https://github.com/zarbopiero963-droid/WinOs-Layer-
Description: WinOs-Layer Linux FastAPI OS API server (LinuxBackend)
 WinOs-Layer portable FastAPI server for Linux. Default backend is
 LinuxBackend (WINOS_BACKEND=auto): real processes/FS/system via the OS API.
 Not a Windows emulator. Binds 127.0.0.1 by default. API key loaded via
 --api-key-file (never printed). Upgrade preserves api_key.txt under
 /opt/winos-api. Flatpak is out of scope (see issue #64).
